type: software
title: "PNetGimini: Provisioning Network Gemini System"
abstract: "A high-concurrency, asynchronous network configuration deployment engine designed for virtual and enterprise topologies. Decouples and orchestrates structured configurations to multi-vendor devices (Cisco/Huawei) via SSH/Telnet, featuring automated pre-change snapshots, surgical diff-based rollback, and structured audit reporting."
